  <item>
    <title>EP46《无忧渡》：常乐剑斩下的是我的眼泪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680f5f628aed253fa3065084</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680f5f628aed253fa3065084</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 11:08:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 前言 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>由林玉芬导演执导，半明半寐原著《半夏》改编，任嘉伦、宋祖儿主演的《无忧渡》结局了。主播们看完后马不停蹄就来更新了。常乐剑斩断了半夏和宣夜的因果，也斩下了我们的眼泪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920"><span>小景Jayda</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈里安</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 时间轴 -</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 《无忧渡》的班底十分豪华。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 《无忧渡》作为志怪类作品，真的很聊斋。让人回想起TVB经典的聊斋系列作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 《嫁衣鸮吟》单元：故事开篇很好地引出了人物，但节奏感不太对，没能清晰展现蛮娘和段言秋之间的感情线。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 《碧玉回春》单元：讲述长生不老背后的代价和背叛故事。镜妖和季离之间缺乏CP感。不过剧本成功展现了人性的复杂面，恐怖氛围也做得十分到位。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 《傀儡生心》单元：整部剧中最精彩的单元没有之一。伍娘的扮演者张子鑫表现非常出色，伍娘的重头戏每段故事都隐含深意，我们都超级喜欢。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a> 《鹈鹕海市》单元：深入探讨了现实与虚幻之间的关系。画中有更加勇敢的半夏和宣夜。整个单元充分展示了导演和编剧丰富的想象力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> 《脱骨双生》单元：围绕欲望、善与恶展开。蛇妖的普通话太差影响了观感。杏仙这个角色的复杂性特别引人深思。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2428">40:28</a> 《洗骨得渡》单元：作为故事的结尾，师叔不择手段。探讨了宣夜的身份认同。究竟何为正义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2574">42:54</a> 对结局的讨论：对编剧在结局安排中深层用意的猜测，以及两位主播对结局的困惑和不解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Music -</span></p><span></span><p><span>ximalaya门铃</span></p><span></span><p><span>《予你人间》-宋祖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>-封面-</span></p><span></span><p><span>iqiyi宣传封面</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 剪辑 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景、哈里安</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63b9a917f00eb2842339f108/lqr7ofa64_Fgadrrk9cP_SdszXSQ.m4a" length="77976220" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhBT__HKZ3-5E7Uo3pc9VHhp3OF9.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP45 你有因睡觉跟父母吵架吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f5635e0decaeb094c83620</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f5635e0decaeb094c83620</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Apr 2025 18:34:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 前言 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>睡眠问题一直困扰着我们。工业革命带来的8小时睡眠制度，父母受8小时睡眠制和早睡早起观念影响，常常对我们的作息习惯有所评判。这是从小到大的疑惑，也是亲子关系中难以避开的话题。在此不提供解决方案，也不想听医生建议，只想分享个人经历、内心挣扎和无奈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920"><span>小景Jayda</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈里安</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 时间轴 -</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> 古代人类睡眠节律和工业革命后的八小时睡眠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> 童年睡眠冲突：父母的批评与惩罚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a> 成年后的睡眠冲突：父母的评判与道德压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 早睡早起和八小时睡眠被父母奉为金科玉律，但是更先进的观念他们无法接受。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> 睡眠习惯作为父母控制手段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 跟父母沟通？不存在！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 学生时期睡眠不足的我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 短睡眠优势与睡眠障碍者的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 改善睡眠的尝试：正念、运动、AI助眠、物理治疗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">26:36</a> 虽然入睡困难，但是睡觉真的很重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1792">29:52</a> 推迟上课时间的合理性</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Music -</span></p><span></span><p><span>门铃音效from喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>-封面-</span></p><span></span><p><span>AI生成</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 剪辑 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景、哈里安</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63b9a917f00eb2842339f108/lnZcheTLhoipDa4bz703tPPG720d.m4a" length="30125018" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniIkJymOz826MPEBMytQFJt6EM9.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep44 从《哪吒2》的海外发行说起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bc34db05a90dfd0d80f9d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bc34db05a90dfd0d80f9d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Feb 2025 09:06:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 导语 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>哪吒2之魔童闹海的热播，中国电影的海外发行再次进入人们的视野。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天来聊聊关于电影这个商品，它的出口有什么特别。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有什么错误欢迎在评论区指出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920"><span>小景Jayda</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈里安</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 时间轴 -</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 出口电影是货物贸易还是服务贸易？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> GATT（关贸总协定）的美法围绕电影的battle</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a> GATS（服务贸易总协定）的美法battle第二回合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> TRIPS（与贸易有关的知识产权协定）将公司纳入版税支付对象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 文化多样性公约：公约强调文化产品具有“双重性质”——既是商品，也是文化载体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 法国电影进口政策</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 韩国电影进口政策</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a> 中国电影进口政策</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1389">23:09</a> 哪吒2的海外发行是否如有的影视微博大v所说是“海外受阻”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Music -</span></p><span></span><p><span>门铃音效from喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>-封面-</span></p><span></span><p><span>《哪吒2之魔童闹海》海报</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 剪辑 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景</span></p><span></span><p><span>-参考文献-</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kevin Lee（2007）"The Little State Department": Hollywood and the MPAA's Influence on US Trade Relations</span></p><span></span><p><span>Frédéric Gimello-Mesplomb（2024）Hundred years of French Film Policy (1925-2025). Power, Policy, and Aesthetic Values within State Intervention for film production in France</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jimmyn Parc et al.（2023）Screen monopoly and diversity: a comparative study between the Korean and French film industries</span></p>]]></description>
