  <item>
    <title>Ep43 《国色芳华》｜你我皆胜意，愿我们不再是胜意</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a64db2247d51713c43d828</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a64db2247d51713c43d828</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Feb 2025 18:28:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 导语 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>《国色芳华》是今年最好看的戏。我最喜欢的是秦胜意这个角色。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我最喜欢编剧对秦胜意这个角色的刻画，让这部剧终于从悬浮的剧情脚踏实地。</span></p><span></span><p><span>理解女性困境，还是要代入她的时代，她的语境，给角色一点时间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920"><span>小景Jayda</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 时间轴 -</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 对杨紫的彩虹屁，相较于细腻的哭戏我更喜欢她在这部剧里喜剧的演绎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 李现的表现也不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 整部剧剧情除了强行双洁我觉得还算满意，希望“名节跟性命比起来，不值一提。”更能落到剧情里。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a> 与《再见爱人》疯狂联动的秦胜意和刘畅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> 秦胜意的悲歌，有的时候我是秦胜意，有的时候我是牡丹。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> 刘畅的在父权制下的压迫与受压迫。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">13:57</a> 刘畅的懦弱我也狠狠带入了，但是更多的时候我也不知道他在燃什么。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 县主作为对照组，依然无法在父权制下摆脱女生传宗接代的剩余价值。张雅钦的气场可能需要更多镜头语言的辅助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Music -</span></p><span></span><p><span>门铃音效from喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>-封面-</span></p><span></span><p><span>《国色芳华》剧照</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 剪辑 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63b9a917f00eb2842339f108/ltkUjh7d-SNTiLwwvcqrN_WDdyor.m4a" length="20652101" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:18:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fneh_CXtWObO1TcpyLUYWTOPMFMX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
