  <item>
    <title>EP42 山姆红黑榜之年货篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678b85f4fd38652366ee198c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678b85f4fd38652366ee198c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Jan 2025 10:49:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 导语 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>全程无广，满满都是我们对山姆的喜爱和怒其不争。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920"><span>小景Jayda</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈里安</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 时间轴 -</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> 广东口味的主播准备或者已经购买的年货</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈里安：黄油鸡蛋卷、什锦比利时巧克力、徐褔记,混合口味新年糖桶、加州原野旋转木马、花旗参茶</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景：绒布自粘对联和福字、蝴蝶兰、大花惠兰、车厘子（3J以上）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 日常爱用物（食物）</span></p><span></span><p><span>清美醇豆浆、MM水果多多麦片、MM三色糙米、有机小麦、藜麦、大颗粒鱼籽虾滑、HMS盐渍牛仔骨、冰鲜三文鱼片、MM马来西亚冷冻猫山王榴莲果肉、MM果干坚果欧包、MM贝果、枣泥蛋糕、多彩樱桃番茄、小花糯玉米、MM海盐苏打饼、MM天选有机蛹虫草、巧克力牛奶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> 日常爱用物（用品）</span></p><span></span><p><span>MM经典卫生纸、抗静电毛毯、妙力悬挂式洁厕魔力球、八奈司铁锅</span></p><span></span><p><span>吐槽难吃食物：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 满记甜品双皮奶、杨枝甘露（几乎所有广东甜品都很难吃，除了广州酒家的红豆沙）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a> MM芋泥麻薯面包、Frutco NFC石榴汁、每日咖啡师冷萃咖啡、MM鸡丝凉面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 鲜剥泰国柚、鲜剥榴莲肉（极速达的鲜剥从未好吃过）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1667">27:47</a> 巨峰葡萄、酸菜黑鱼片、冬阴功、康莎紫薯、原浆半壳生蚝、MM奶油小方</span></p><span></span><p><span>离谱经历分享：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2027">33:47</a> 在山姆买营养补充剂还是比较安心的，天猫买营养补充剂的离谱经历。食品安全真的令人担忧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 音乐 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜马拉雅门铃音效</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 封面-</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜马拉雅AI生成</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 剪辑 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈里安、小景</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63b9a917f00eb2842339f108/llvejNtcLwHAN-BpO9j5T9cgoXFi.m4a" length="52866680" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgBjZjX6Babw1xfSY-H3Q7lUzy6.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP41 再见爱人4 reaction｜被绞杀的麦琳们真的该死吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673ff65a11045e78e5fc21ee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673ff65a11045e78e5fc21ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Nov 2024 03:45:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️主播：鸭鸭__</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播：小景（📕 小红书：小景Jayda）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播：哈里安</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏩ Timeline</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">1:20</a> 舆论的高地不是你占领就是我占领，如果是那样的人在占领，那还不如我去占领。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 麦琳更易受到全网审判，一是因为这类人生活中常见，便于大家投射；二是因为她是软柿子，容易被节目组恶剪。今年的剪辑明显是有带节奏倾向的，观察室是精英群体，擅长捧高踩低。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 其他5位嘉宾都是有镜头经验的，在隐藏性格缺陷方面训练有素，有天然优势。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> 李行亮的迷惑行为1：理工男是个隐藏情感冷漠的好借口。麦琳即使在表达不满时也会提及李行亮的好，但李行亮总在传达自己的委屈，把麦琳讲得一无是处、不可理喻。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> 虽说大家都在审判麦琳，但是不同的群体针对和投射的点有一些差异。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 李行亮的迷惑行为2：隐藏在彪悍女性背后的体面男人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> 社会对全职太太的歧视依然存在。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">24:57</a> 节目组内容安排不合理的佐证1：第五期加更中才放出另外两位女性帮助麦琳认识自己的谈心内容，这难道不是情感治愈类节目应该重点关注的部分吗？其他两位女性对麦琳的友好，其实能侧面反映出麦琳的行为并没有那么恶劣。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 节目组内容安排不合理的佐证2：生育问题好像有被刻意淡化。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 麦麦为什么对进入李行亮的精神世界如此抵触？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a> 专用于女性受害者的“吃绝户”一词居然被移情给身为男性既得利益者的李行亮？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> “汉服事件”只是消费观念和教育理念的差异，不能由此说明麦琳是个自私的坏妈妈。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 对麦琳的关注不希望只停留在“失去自我导致的性格扭曲”这一层，希望能关注逼疯麦琳的背后原因以及其中存在的女性群体困境。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> 麦琳或许只能算她们家的出纳，并不实际掌握财权。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> “麦琳是否是糟糠妻”重要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 李行亮的扭曲在于，想做好男人，但只想做旧脚本中的好男人，没能力或没意愿提供新脚本中好男人需要提供的情绪价值。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a> 李行亮的迷惑行为3：喜欢靠近有“灵魂共鸣”的理想女性。李行亮看中的其实是女性的服务性和工具性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2904">48:24</a> 对节目组规则制定的质疑：怎么定义关系中的强势方？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2971">49:31</a> 李行亮的迷惑行为4：在法定离婚冷静期只有一个月的情况下，为什么麦琳提出离婚需要冷静三个月？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3109">51:49</a> 解决情绪问题难道不是解决问题吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎶 Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vaxenn - Holidays</span></p><span></span><p><span>厂牌：Vlog No Copyright Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>地址：</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eaWhoPrpyM0" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eaWhoPrpyM0"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎬 剪辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>鸭鸭、哈里安</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgNEF07zETW3vO9N4h1sOV9ynJDd.m4a" length="56356308" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgMKTLqQ4Yyqt_3z6ffA0Xw9qkC7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP40 《楠丁格尔先生》掀起风波，优秀女性的成就被剥夺</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f64d8b69b6a485e84a676c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f64d8b69b6a485e84a676c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Sep 2024 06:15:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 导语 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱奇艺片单中由胡歌主演的《楠丁格尔先生》引起广泛而激烈的讨论，一个杰出的女性试图通过电视剧逐渐被片面化，甚至被抹去。我们以此话题作为出发点，给大家介绍那些被偷走的女性成就，那些改变人类历史的女性，她们需要被谈论、被书写、被记住。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65356e7b000000000400b2c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65356e7b000000000400b2c4&amp;apptime=1704910920"><span>小景Jayda</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈里安</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 时间轴 -</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>对于《楠丁格尔先生》的讨论：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 《楠丁格尔先生》引起舆论的轩然大波</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a> 南丁格尔是统计学家，皇家统计学院的第一个女院士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 窃取伟大女性的荣光，放到男性身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a> 哈里安猜测剧情走向，十分令人难过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> “先生”对于女性的尊称是一种性别歧视，已经不符合当代的语境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a> 《Beklaute Frauen》（翻译为：《被偷走名声的女性》）一书中介绍了那些改变人类历史的女性，她们的影响力已被从历史中抹去，权利系统阻碍了每个女人的发展</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那些被偷走的女性成就：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> Zelda Fitzgerald：被丈夫抄袭了作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">15:11</a> 中里恒子：被川端康成偷走作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a>太田静子：被太宰治抄袭了日记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> Rosalind Franklin: DNA双螺旋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">26:36</a> 男性诋毁女性的惯用套路：情绪化、发疯、性格古怪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 对屠呦呦被评价性格的联想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1847">30:47</a> Nettie Stevens: 性染色体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2045">34:05</a> Alice Ball: 治愈麻风病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> 吴健雄：核物理学家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">41:02</a> 优秀的女性，她们的姓名掩埋在历史的尘埃里，等待被发现，被书写，被记住。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 资料收集过程中那些被偷走成就的女性 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hedy Lamarr: Radio Guidance System (later becoming GPS and Wi-Fi)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Marion Donovan: Disposable Diapers</span></p><span></span><p><span>Elizabeth Magie Phillips: The Landlord’s Game/ Monopoly</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vera Rubin: Dark Matter</span></p><span></span><p><span>Margaret Knight: Square-Bottomed Paper Bag</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dr. Grace Murray Hopper: Computer Programming Language</span></p><span></span><p><span>Caresse Crosby: The Modern Bra</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ada Harris: Hair Straightener</span></p><span></span><p><span>Esther Lederberg: Microbial Genetics</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jocelyn Bell Burnell: Pulsars</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ada Lovelace: Computer Algorithm</span></p><span></span><p><span>Katherine Johnson: Moon Landing Path</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lise Meitner: Nuclear Fission</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mary Anderson: Windshield Wipers</span></p><span></span><p><span>Margaret Keane: Artwork Stolen by Husband</span></p><span></span><p><span>The ENIAC Programmers: First Electronic Computer</span></p><span></span><p><span>Trotula of Salerno: Women’s Health Findings</span></p><span></span><p><span>Candace Pert: Neuroscience Findings</span></p><span></span><p><span>Esther Lederberg：Genes Work</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ida Tacke：Finding Rhenium and Masurium</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 参考资料 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>“19 Discoveries by Women That Were Credited to Men | Marie Claire.” n.d. Accessed September 26, 2024. <a data-url="https://www.marieclaire.com/culture/g5026/female-discoveries-credited-to-men/" href="https://www.marieclaire.com/culture/g5026/female-discoveries-credited-to-men/">www.marieclaire.com</a>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>BBC News. 2015. “The Women Whom Science Forgot,” June 18, 2015, sec. Science &amp; Environment. <a data-url="https://www.bbc.com/news/science-environment-33157396" href="https://www.bbc.com/news/science-environment-33157396">www.bbc.com</a>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Collins, Sibrina N. 2021. “The Importance of Storytelling in Chemical Education.” Nature Chemistry 13 (1): 1–2. <a data-url="https://doi.org/10/ghrq45" href="https://doi.org/10/ghrq45">doi.org</a>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>“Nettie Stevens Discovered XY Sex Chromosomes. She Didn’t Get Credit Because She Had Two X’s. | Vox.” n.d. Accessed September 26, 2024. <a data-url="https://www.vox.com/2016/7/7/12105830/nettie-stevens-genetics-gender-sex-chromosomes" href="https://www.vox.com/2016/7/7/12105830/nettie-stevens-genetics-gender-sex-chromosomes">www.vox.com</a>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ricks, Delthia. 2023. “Overlooked No More: Alice Ball, Chemist Who Created a Treatment for Leprosy.” The New York Times, April 8, 2023, sec. Obituaries. <a data-url="https://www.nytimes.com/2023/04/08/obituaries/alice-ball-overlooked.html" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2023/04/08/obituaries/alice-ball-overlooked.html">www.nytimes.com</a>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Schöler, Leonie. 2024. Beklaute Frauen. <a data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36989438/" href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36989438/">book.douban.com</a>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Watson, James D., and Francis HC Crick. 1953. “Molecular Structure of Nucleic Acids: A Structure for Deoxyribose Nucleic Acid.” Nature 171 (4356): 737–38. <a data-url="https://doi.org/10/g4q" href="https://doi.org/10/g4q">doi.org</a>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>“Women Who Had Their Work Stolen From Them by Men.” n.d. History Collection (blog). Accessed September 26, 2024. <a data-url="https://historycollection.com/women-who-had-their-work-stolen-from-them-by-men/" href="https://historycollection.com/women-who-had-their-work-stolen-from-them-by-men/">historycollection.com</a>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 音乐 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>End of Innocence- Alexandre Desplat</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 剪辑 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>小景、哈里安</span></p>]]></description>
